     "alt": "Map My Sheet",
     "w": 118,
     "h": 128
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "We believe in the power of integration: connecting your disparate systems, applications, products, databases, and tools into a symphony of efficiency. And we champion automation: taking the difficulty out of your day-to-day operations, freeing your team to focus on what truly matters.",
